---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="David Lehmann - About">
  <div class="flex flex-col gap-6 mb-[6rem] lg:mb-[12rem]">
    <p class="text-gray-500">
      I'm David, a UX/UI designer focused on creating digital experiences that
      feel effortless. I care deeply about the small, often invisible details —
      spacing, motion, hierarchy — that shape how people feel when they use a
      product, even if they can't name why. My approach blends research,
      iteration, and close collaboration with engineering to make sure designs
      don't just look good, but actually work. I enjoy owning projects
      end-to-end, from early concepts to shipped features. When I'm not
      designing, I'm usually digging vinyl or riding my 90s Singletrack, always
      looking for the next thing worth obsessing over the details of.
    </p>
    <div>
      <span class="text-gray-500 flex pb-2 mt-6">Competences</span>
      <ol class="list-disc list-inside">
        <li>User Research</li>
        <li>Wireframing & Prototyping</li>
        <li>UI Design</li>
        <li>Web Design</li>
        <li>Design Systems</li>
        <li>Motion Design</li>
        <li>Design Ops</li>
      </ol>
    </div>
    <div>
      <span class="text-gray-500 flex pb-2">Stack</span>
      <ol class="list-disc list-inside">
        <li>Figma</li>
        <li>Jitter</li>
        <li>Linear</li>
        <li>HTML/CSS</li>
        <li>NextJS</li>
        <li>Astro</li>
        <li>Tailwind</li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
